OL,3,AEsDeeKid mystery no problem for fans
OL,4,Aafter 'insane' All Points East set
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere might be fewer people guessing
OL,7,Fwho he is these days - but if
OL,8,FEsDeeKid's only UK festival appearance
OL,9,Fthis summer is anything to go by,
OL,10,Fno-one seems to care.
OL,12,FThe masked rapper took to the All
OL,13,FPoints East stage on Sunday night,
OL,14,Freeling off his signature raw and
OL,15,Fpunchy bars from on top of a castle.
OL,17,FWhen EsDeeKid, who raps with a Scouse
OL,18,Faccent and only ever reveals his eyes,
OL,19,Fburst on to the scene last year
OL,20,Feveryone was convinced he was Timothee
OL,21,FChalamet.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
